        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Lights
    - rid: 552786204080472164
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1413198099660800
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reset light {0}'s six states to the {1} type's defaults?
    - rid: 552786204080472165
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1413198112243712
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reset States
    - rid: 552786204080472166
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212544
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its index in the level's lights, which surfaces, media and switches pick it by
    - rid: 552786204080472167
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212545
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: What tag switches and terminals switch it by (0 is untagged)
    - rid: 552786204080472168
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212546
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Mostly a preset of its six states: choosing one offers to reset them to the type''s defaults.'
    - rid: 552786204080472169
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212547
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How many ticks into its states it starts (so lights can be out of step with each other)
    - rid: 552786204080472170
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212548
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It's active (on) as the level starts
    - rid: 552786204080472171
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212549
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its intensities are slaved (each of Marathon's own light types has it set)
    - rid: 552786204080472172
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212550
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Runs through all six states in turn, rather than staying active or inactive
    - rid: 552786204080472173
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212551
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'How its intensity changes through the state: constant, linear, smooth, flicker (and Aleph One''s random and fluorescent)'
    - rid: 552786204080472174
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212552
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How long the state lasts, in ticks (30 a second)
    - rid: 552786204080472175
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212553
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The most a random amount added to the period each time can be, in ticks (30 a second)
    - rid: 552786204080472176
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212554
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The intensity the state goes to, from 0 (dark) to 1 (full light)
    - rid: 552786204080472177
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151326863212555
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The most a random amount added to the intensity each time can be (1 is full light)
